Suggests: bluez, bluez-obexd
Description: full-featured Bluetooth manager for the terminal (ratatui)
 bluetuith-rs is a terminal user interface for managing Bluetooth adapters
 and devices over BlueZ D-Bus. It provides adapter power/discovery control,
 device pairing and connection, OBEX Object Push file send and receive (with
 an authorization dialog and a configurable receive directory), AVRCP media
 playback including shuffle/repeat, PAN networking, audio profiles and a
 pairing agent.
 .
 The interface is built with ratatui and supports mouse input, configurable
 keybindings, nine colour themes, search/filter, an English/Chinese bilingual
 UI and a --demo mode that runs without Bluetooth hardware.
